 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 526557,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You want to cover a garden with topsoil. The garden is 5 meters by 8 meters. There is a path in the middle of the garden that is 8 meters long and 0.75 meters wide. What is the area of the garden you need to cover with topsoil?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Determine the area of the garden.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A{\\rm{ }} = {\\rm{ }}L{\\rm{ }} \\times {\\rm{ }}W{\\rm{ }} = {\\rm{ }}\\left( 5 \\right)\\left( 8 \\right){\\rm{ }} = 40{\\rm{ }}{{\\rm{\\ m}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Determine the area of the sidewalk.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A{\\rm{ }} = {\\rm{ }}L{\\rm{ }} \\times {\\rm{ }}W{\\rm{ }} = {\\rm{ }}\\left( {0.75} \\right)\\left( 8 \\right){\\rm{ }} = 6{\\rm{ }}{{\\rm{\\ m}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: Subtract the area of the sidewalk from the garden to find how much topsoil you need.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"40{\\rm{\\ }}{{\\rm{m}}^2} - 6{\\rm{\\ }}{{\\rm{m}}^2} = 34\\;{{\\rm{\\ m}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>You need to purchase 34 square meters of topsoil.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "34 m<sup>2</sup>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
